---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="BCL App — Join the waitlist"
  description="The Blue Collar Labs app is coming soon. AI coach in your pocket — every trade, free to begin. Join the waitlist to get first access on iOS or Android."
  ogImage="/og/school.png"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-steel-800 via-steel-900 to-steel-900"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-96 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,theme(colors.volt.500/15),transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="container-wide pt-20 pb-12 md:pt-28 md:pb-16">
      <p class="eyebrow">BCL App · Coming soon</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05]">
        AI coach in your pocket.<br />
        <span class="text-volt-500">Every trade. Built by tradesmen.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-steel-300">
        Ask any AI question about your trade and get a useful answer — in plain language, with the safety, code, and credentialed-work caveats called out plainly. Snap a photo of a panel, a plate, a part, a wound on the shop dog if you have to. We're polishing the last edges.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base text-steel-400">
        Drop your name on the waitlist and we'll ping you the second TestFlight + Play Store builds open up.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Waitlist intake</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Get first access.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-steel-300">Five fields. Under a minute. We don't sell or share your info — see <a href="/privacy" class="text-volt-500 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">/privacy</a>.</p>

        <form
          name="app-waitlist"
          method="POST"
          action="/.netlify/functions/waitlist"
          class="mt-6 grid gap-4"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="app-waitlist" />
          <input type="hidden" name="source" value="Web direct" />
          <p class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></p>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Your name</span>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="name"
              required
              autocomplete="name"
              placeholder="First + last"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Email</span>
            <input
              type="email"
              name="email"
              required
              autocomplete="email"
              placeholder="you@email.com"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Your trade</span>
            <select
              name="trade"
              required
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            >
              <option value="">Pick one…</option>
              <option value="Electrician">Electrician</option>
              <option value="Plumber">Plumber</option>
              <option value="HVAC">HVAC</option>
              <option value="Mechanic">Mechanic</option>
              <option value="Body Shop">Body shop</option>
              <option value="Welder">Welder</option>
              <option value="Carpenter">Carpenter</option>
              <option value="Painter">Painter</option>
              <option value="GC / Builder">GC / Builder</option>
              <option value="Roofer">Roofer</option>
              <option value="Landscaper">Landscaper</option>
              <option value="Chef / Cook">Chef / Cook</option>
              <option value="Cosmetologist">Cosmetologist</option>
              <option value="Stylist">Stylist</option>
              <option value="Barber">Barber</option>
              <option value="Esthetician">Esthetician</option>
              <option value="Other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
            <label class="grid gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Where you sit</span>
              <select
                name="role"
                class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
              >
                <option value="">Pick one…</option>
                <option value="Apprentice">Apprentice</option>
                <option value="Journeyman">Journeyman</option>
                <option value="Owner">Owner</option>
                <option value="Other">Other</option>
              </select>
            </label>

            <label class="grid gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">Phone</span>
              <select
                name="platform"
                class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
              >
                <option value="Either">iOS or Android — either</option>
                <option value="iOS">iOS</option>
                <option value="Android">Android</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">State <span class="text-steel-500 font-normal">(optional)</span></span>
            <input
              type="text"
              name="state"
              maxlength="60"
              placeholder="e.g. NJ"
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            />
          </label>

          <label class="grid gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-steel-200">What would make this app a daily-driver for you? <span class="text-steel-500 font-normal">(optional)</span></span>
            <textarea
              name="note"
              rows="3"
              maxlength="1000"
              placeholder="The first feature that would change a real workday for you."
              class="w-full rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
            ></textarea>
          </label>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary mt-2">Join the waitlist</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-steel-500">By submitting you agree to BCL contacting you about the app launch. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">What's coming</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">First-look features</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-steel-300">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 inline-block h-2 w-2 flex-none rounded-sm bg-volt-500"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-steel-100">Trade-aware chat.</strong> Ask in your language — code references, parts, measurements, prep — get answers that aren't dumbed down.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 inline-block h-2 w-2 flex-none rounded-sm bg-volt-500"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-steel-100">Photo-first.</strong> Snap a panel, a recipe, a hairline, a fender. Get a useful read.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 inline-block h-2 w-2 flex-none rounded-sm bg-volt-500"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-steel-100">Voice-first.</strong> Dictate notes hands-free on the truck or in the booth.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 inline-block h-2 w-2 flex-none rounded-sm bg-volt-500"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-steel-100">Safety + code calls.</strong> When credentialed work or compliance is in play, the app says so plainly.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-volt-500/30 bg-volt-500/5 p-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volt-500">Want more than a waitlist?</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-steel-300">The <a href="/cohort-2026" class="text-volt-500 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Founding-25 cohort</a> ships now — paid, lifetime grandfathered pricing, full apprentice-track program.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
